  - Action 'propel' is only available if the ship has a Propulsion module.
  - Otherwise, the dialog system asks the decider to select N of the ship's modules; the choice text
   is: `<Decider> must select <N> of <Ship>s module(s) (separated by comma):` and the module list is
   alphabetically ordered.
  - Otherwise a successful action leads to no output unless another rule specifies output.
  - After printing an error message the program must continue and wait for the next input.
  - During 'move', the target tile must not be covered by cover or occupied by another ship.
